      "worked_solution": "Note that the length of a side of one cell is \n\n$$\n\\frac{6\\,\\text{m}}{3}=2\\,\\text{m}.\n$$\n\nThe line segment has a length of $6$ cells, hence the total measure is \n\n$$\nAB=6\\cdot 2\\,\\text{m}=12\\,\\text{m}.\n$$",
