      "worked_solution": "Note that the length of a side of one cell is \n\n$$\n\\frac{1\\,\\text{in}}{4}=0.25\\,\\text{in}.\n$$\n\nThe line segment has a length of $7$ cells, hence the total measure is \n\n$$\nMN=7\\cdot 0.25\\,\\text{in}=1.75\\,\\text{in}.\n$$",
