      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14150837/assets/0136ebffa14d6ce909ae068473da43f576a0bb18731fe281adb57cb6319b35fc.png)\n\nWhat is the measure of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ}$ shown above?",
      "worked_solution": "Note that the length of a side of one cell is \n\n$$\n\\frac{1\\,\\text{mm}}{2}=0.5\\,\\text{mm}.\n$$\n\nThe line segment has a length of $8$ cells, hence the total measure is \n\n$$\nPQ=8\\cdot 0.5\\,\\text{mm}=4\\,\\text{mm}.\n$$",
