      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "Which of the following pictures shows a line segment of $7.5\\,\\text{cm}$ long?",
      "worked_solution": "Note that one of the points of each segment is aligned with the zero-mark on the ruler.\n\nWe will use the rulers to determine which segment has a length of $7.5\\,\\text{cm}.$ To do this, we need to find a picture where the value that corresponds to the second point gives us exactly $7.5.$\n\nThe correct option is the following.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14150837/assets/392b3af6a2e540510c8bb19350226faebe2d2a6183da015473ba5379a8a92d5d.png)",
